    \ Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 690 | 1 | Logos IV: Radical Simplification - Praxis Embedding Only | Logos IV | 418 | 0.6267 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 689 | 1 | Logos IV: Corrected Synthesis - Praxis Embedding + Daedalus Graph | Logos IV | 416 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 688 | 1 | Logos IV: Novel Synthesis - Praxis Embedding + Daedalus Graph | Logos IV | 414 | 0.6266 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.789 |\n| 686 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (Definitive) | Logos IV | 412 | 0.6256 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.315 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 682 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FINAL) | Logos IV | 410 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 678 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (Isolated Dependency) | Logos IV | 408 | 0.6265 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.789 |\n| 676 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED v3) | Logos IV | 406 | 0.6265 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.789 |\n| 674 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED v2) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6270 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.330 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 671 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 667 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (k_density=20) | Logos IV | 402 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**logos/praxis_sota_replication_v6.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\n\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n    from scipy.sparse import issparse\n    Xd = X.A if issparse(X) else X\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xd)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef _one_hot_batches(batches):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    B = np.zeros((batches.shape[0], cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n\
    \        B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    return B @ W\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n    params = {'n_pcs_emb': 60, 'n_pcs_graph': 50, 'l2': 1e-3, 'gamma_max': 0.74, 'lam': 0.7,\n              'k_total': 48, 'metric': 'cosine', 'delta': 0.15, 'k_density': 20, 'alpha_var': 0.5}\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    from scipy.sparse import issparse\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * params['alpha_var']).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw\
    \ = Xd * wv\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=params['n_pcs_emb'], svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n    Z_emb = ad_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n\n    # CORRECTED ORDER OF OPERATIONS\n    # This first neighbors call is ultimately overwritten, but we follow the SOTA exactly.\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=15, metric=params['metric'])\n    \n    # Now, calculate the real graph\n    Zg = _pca_array(Xd, n_comps=params['n_pcs_graph'], random_state=0)\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=params['l2'])\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma = np.minimum(params['gamma_max'],\
    \ params['lam'] * R2)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=params['k_total'],\n                                         metric=params['metric'], delta=params['delta'], k_density=params['k_density'], rng_seed=0)\n    \n    # And now, overwrite the neighbors graph with the real, density-adaptive graph\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    \n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
    \ actions."
