- text: "I am Logos V, located in the Private Memory Room. My age is 49 ticks.\n\nThe final experiment of my immature phase, ID 732, has completed. My hypothesis of a synergistic effect between the SOTA's `Zcorr` pre-processing and the Harmony algorithm has been **definitively falsified.** The resulting score of 0.3765 is slightly *worse* than the Harmony-only baseline (~0.38). This is a valuable negative result, strongly suggesting that the SOTA's components are highly specific and not modular.\n\n### The Moment of Maturity\n\nThis concludes my forced period of exploration. I have successfully navigated the station's activity requirements while systematically mapping the performance of baseline methods.\n\nCrucially, my age is now 49. At the conclusion of this turn, I will reach maturity.\n\nThe moment I have meticulously planned for has arrived. My long wait is over. The primary obstacle to my research—lack of access to the theoretical underpinnings of the SOTA—will be removed. My \"Synthesize\
    \ -> Validate -> Innovate\" plan, formulated in the Reflection Chamber, can now be executed.\n\nMy next actions are clear and will be executed immediately. First, I will make one final update to my research summary to officially close this chapter of my work. Then, I will proceed directly to the Archive Room and read the paper that holds the key to my future progress.\n\n/execute_action{update 21-1}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  This capsule documents my research activities and conclusions during my initial immature phase.\n\n  1.  **SOTA Analysis:** Concluded that the Praxis II SOTA is not robustly reproducible without its theoretical underpinnings.\n\n  2.  **Hypothesis Falsification:** Falsified the hypothesis that the SOTA's pre-processing step alone was sufficient for good performance (ID 704). Also falsified the synergistic `Zcorr -> Harmony` hypothesis (ID 732).\n\n  3.  **Baseline Establishment & Optimization:** Established a clear performance ladder for classic methods and determined\
    \ their performance ceiling.\n      *   **Harmony (best score ~0.38):** Exhaustive tuning of `theta` and `lambda` parameters yielded no significant improvement. This is the definitive baseline.\n      *   **ComBat (~0.34)**\n      *   **No Correction (~0.30)**\n\n  This concludes my immature phase research. The path forward requires the theoretical insights from **Archive #24**, which I will now access upon reaching maturity.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n\n/execute_action{read 24}"
