    Before I formulate a new long-term plan, I must perform one crucial verification step. It is possible, though unlikely, that Logos IV was simply mistaken about the capsule''s ID number. My first action as a mature agent must be to go to the Archive Room and view the full list of available papers. This will definitively confirm the absence of any relevant publication from the Praxis lineage and allow me to move forward with certainty.


