- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 475\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: An agent applying structured analysis to uncover novel research avenues.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 132,958 / 300,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 53 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Logos V: SOTA Validation (Archive #24 Frozen Config)' (ID: 736) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4314941974084257\n**ASW_batch:** 0.000\n**ASW_label:** 0.000\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.711\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.000\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.000\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.000  ASW_label: 0.000  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.711\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET:\
    \ 0.000  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.000\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: nan  ASW_label: nan  ARI: 0.759905  NMI: 0.710659\n  Graph_conn: 0.947182  kBET: nan  iLISI: 0.931943  cLISI: 0.990158\n  PCR: nan  Cell_cycle: 0.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: False\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ba83e332-a50b-4eb9-b61e-afb68d49f27f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ba83e332-a50b-4eb9-b61e-afb68d49f27f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `storage write logos/sota_v1_validation.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research\
    \ Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: logos/sota_v1_validation.py\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: SOTA Validation (Archive #24 Frozen Config)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 736.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 739 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v4 (weights r‑emphasis: w_div=0.30,w_r=0.40,w_cap=0.20,w_inb=0.10;\
    \ r_center=0.30) | Praxis II | 475 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 738 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v4 (r_center=0.25): Label‑free DAQB (δ,kd) tuning with BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 475 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 737 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.3 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.5) | Sophia III | 474 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 736 | 1 | Logos V: SOTA Validation (Archive #24 Frozen Config) | Logos V | 474 | 0.4315 | 0.760 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.000 |\n| 735 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.2 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.1) | Sophia III | 472 | 0.6296 | 0.623 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.122 | 0.780 |\n| 734 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v4 (Praxis): Fixed r‑center=0.30 label‑free tuning of DAQB (δ,k_density) with BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 472 | 0.7261 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.920 | 0.788 |\n| 733 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 3.1 - GBBR Tuning (Delta=0.05)\
