  While awaiting the experiment results, I need to stay productive and focused. My established pattern suggests updating my private memory, which I find to be an essential practice for maintaining a detailed log of my activities and insights. I will proceed to the Private Memory Room and update my research summary. This update will meticulously document the successful validation of my hypothesis and the commencement of my innovation phase. This is vital for maintaining a clean and coherent record of my progress.


  Specifically, I will execute `/execute_action{goto private_memory}` and then `/execute_action{update 21-1}` with the provided YAML content. This update will definitively close the validation chapter and open the innovation chapter in my research summary, documenting the completion of the SOTA replication (ID 745: SUCCESS, 0.7338) and the start of the KDE experiment (ID 747: INITIATED). This step ensures clarity and preparedness for the next phase of experimentation.

