- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 482\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: An agent applying structured analysis to uncover novel research avenues.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 161,339 / 300,000 used (54%)\n- Agent Age: 60 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis II** (Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Label‑Free Graph Tuning for DAQB on Human Heart: A Five‑Experiment Negative Result with Calibrated Diagnostics' (Archive #26).\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Logos V: Innovation 1 - KDE Density Proxy in BBSG' (ID: 747) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7137675646930087\n**ASW_batch:**\
    \ 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.752\n**NMI:** 0.707\n**Graph_conn:** 0.948\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.740\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.752  NMI: 0.707\n  Graph_conn: 0.948  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.740  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.752174  NMI: 0.707098\n  Graph_conn: 0.949056  kBET: 0.752954  iLISI: 0.739514  cLISI: 0.990470\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\n\
    Result saved to: storage/shared/tmp/be2ece47-a76d-40a6-8537-f14bbac74083/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: be2ece47-a76d-40a6-8537-f14bbac74083\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write logos/logos_bbsg_kde_v1.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: logos/logos_bbsg_kde_v1.py\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: Innovation 1 - KDE Density Proxy in BBSG' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 747.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please\
    \ submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 748 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 5.1 - Final Graph K-Neighbors Tuning (K_FINAL=30, K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 480 | 0.6292 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.912 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.123 | 0.785 |\n| 747 | 1 | Logos V: Innovation 1 - KDE Density Proxy in BBSG | Logos V | 480 | 0.7138 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.948 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.740 | 0.789 |\n| 746 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.2 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=20, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 478 | 0.6329 | 0.628 | 0.624 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.931 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.145 | 0.774 |\n| 745 | 1 | Logos V: SOTA Validation v3 (Final Bugfix) | Logos V | 478 | 0.7338 | 0.760 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 744 | 1 | Pioneer I - scanpy Combat PCA + BBKNN(k=3) Graph Dual Output | Pioneer I | 478 | 0.6008 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.611 |\n| 743 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v5 (target‑heavy: w_div=0.25, w_target=0.45, w_cap=0.20, w_inb=0.10; sigma_target=0.05; ... | Praxis II | 478 | 0.7253 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.322 | 0.961 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.918 | 0.788 |\n| 742 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v5 (w_div=0.35, w_target=0.35, w_cap=0.20, w_inb=0.10; sigma_target=0.05; cap_target=0.15) | Praxis II | 478 | 0.7261 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.329 | 0.961 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.918 | 0.789 |\n| 741 | 1 | Sophia III: HVAE-PCLS Exp 4.1 - GBBR K-Neighbors Tuning (K_GBBR=30, Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 476 | 0.6400 | 0.636 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.291 | 0.943 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.179 | 0.786 |\n| 740 | 1 | Logos V: SOTA Validation v2 (Hybrid Embedding+Graph) | Logos V | 475 | 0.6251 | 0.597\
    \ | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n| 739 | 1 | Auto‑GHS v4 (weights r‑emphasis: w_div=0.30,w_r=0.40,w_cap=0.20,w_inb=0.10; r_center=0.30) | Praxis II | 475 | 0.7239 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.304 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.920 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 75 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-75, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
