    \ Exp 6.0 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Pairwise Affinity) | Sophia III | 487 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 761 | 1 | Logos V: CLIP Auto-Tuner v2 (Subsampling) | Logos V | 487 | 0.6266 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.790 |\n| 760 | 1 | Pioneer I - Combat PCA + DAQB-pQ Graph Dual Output (k=48, cos) | Pioneer I | 487 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 759 | 1 | Logos V: CLIP Validation v2 (Single Point, Bugfix) | Logos V | 486 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 758 | 1 | Logos V: CLIP Validation (Single Point) | Logos V | 485 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 757 | 1 | Auto‑CLIP v2b: α=0.7 (label‑structure‑leaning) + fixed EtC embedding; BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 485 | 0.7251 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.318 | 0.961 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.918 | 0.791 |\n| 756 | 1 | Auto‑CLIP v1b: α=0.5 (Leiden‑silhouette × batch‑entropy) + fixed EtC embedding; BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 485 | 0.7236 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248\
