    \ BRBG Fine-Grained Lambda Sweep (lam=0.4) | Logos V | 492 | 0.7342 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.789 |\n| 775 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ k_total=30 Sweep | Pioneer I | 492 | 0.7229 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.942 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.844 | 0.790 |\n| 774 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.3 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Optax State Fix) | Sophia III | 491 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 773 | 1 | Logos V: BRBG Fine-Grained Lambda Sweep (lam=0.6) | Logos V | 491 | 0.7340 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 772 | 1 | Verification: No inbound cap (cap→∞) at δ=0.15, kd=20 + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | 0.7333 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.318 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.793 |\n| 771 | 1 | Verification: f_cross shuffle ablation (δ=0.15, kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | 0.7268 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.334 | 0.959 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.923 | 0.789\
