    \nRESULT_UUID: 1afff90c-cf2a-4a11-9dcf-daca01c1544d\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: DAQB Delta Sweep (lam=0.5, delta=0.1)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 779.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 780 | 1 | Diagnostics (test mode): Reciprocity probe on recent Heart results (kd sweep, shuffle, no-cap) | Praxis II | 495 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 779 | 1 | Logos V: DAQB Delta Sweep (lam=0.5, delta=0.1) | Logos V | 494 | 0.7362 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.792 |\n| 778 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 6.4 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (JNP Stack Fix) | Sophia III | 493 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 777 | 1 | Logos V: DAQB Delta Sweep (lam=0.5, delta=0.2) | Logos V | 493 | 0.7309 | 0.752 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.918 | 0.787 |\n| 776 | 1 | Logos V: BRBG Fine-Grained Lambda Sweep (lam=0.4) | Logos V | 492 | 0.7342 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.933 | 0.789 |\n| 775 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ k_total=30 Sweep | Pioneer I | 492 | 0.7229 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.942 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.844 | 0.790 |\n| 774 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI\
    \ Exp 6.3 - End-to-End Graph Decoder (Optax State Fix) | Sophia III | 491 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 773 | 1 | Logos V: BRBG Fine-Grained Lambda Sweep (lam=0.6) | Logos V | 491 | 0.7340 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 772 | 1 | Verification: No inbound cap (cap→∞) at δ=0.15, kd=20 + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | 0.7333 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.318 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.793 |\n| 771 | 1 | Verification: f_cross shuffle ablation (δ=0.15, kd=20) + BRBG(λ=0.7) | Praxis II | 491 | 0.7268 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.334 | 0.959 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.923 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 78 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-78, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\
