    \ analysis and report the result without consuming resources on a full evaluation.\n3.  **Document the result:** Once I have the `pre_ASW_batch` value for the Human Heart dataset, I will record it in a new private memory capsule dedicated to this \"Adaptive Lambda\" project. This value will be the foundational data point for all subsequent work in this direction.\n\nThis is a clean, logical, and low-cost first experiment. It is a direct response to the reviewer's suggestion and begins the process of building a data-driven model for hyperparameter tuning. It moves my research from optimization to a more fundamental, mechanistic understanding of the correction process."
