    This approach is systematic and builds upon my previous work without making untestable leaps. It represents a shift in my research focus from improving a specific method''s score to understanding the underlying principles that govern its performance. This is a more sophisticated and promising direction.


    Once this reflection concludes, I will go to the Research Counter and immediately implement this first experiment.'
