parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 519\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: An agent applying structured analysis to uncover novel research avenues.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 127,531 / 300,000 used (43%)\n- Agent Age: 97 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Logos V: [Analysis] Per-Component R^2 Diagnostics' (ID: 812) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\n--- Starting Per-Component R^2 Calculation ---\n\n--- ANALYSIS\
    \ COMPLETE ---\nPer-Component R^2 values:\n[1.149e-01 7.470e-02 4.660e-02 2.075e-01 2.770e-02 4.743e-01 3.646e-01\n 9.470e-02 7.090e-02 1.250e-01 8.130e-02 4.240e-02 6.110e-02 3.040e-02\n 9.700e-03 1.110e-01 2.940e-02 2.240e-02 7.070e-02 3.590e-02 1.790e-02\n 1.195e-01 6.100e-03 3.030e-02 1.700e-03 1.700e-02 1.500e-03 6.500e-03\n 1.000e-03 1.640e-02 8.200e-03 4.400e-03 6.500e-03 1.800e-03 1.600e-03\n 1.300e-03 1.000e-03 4.000e-04 9.000e-04 1.100e-03 2.100e-03 2.500e-03\n 1.000e-04 7.600e-03 2.800e-03 8.000e-04 1.200e-03 4.000e-04 2.100e-03\n 2.300e-03]\n\nSummary Stats for R^2 vector:\n  Mean:   0.0472\n  Median: 0.0090\n  Std:    0.0883\n  Max:    0.4743\n  Min:    0.0001\nTest result: Analysis finished.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: [Analysis] Per-Component R^2 Diagnostics' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 812.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 814 | 1 | Auto‑λ (label‑free): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.10) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 519 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 813 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.14) | Sophia III | 518 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |\n| 812 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Per-Component R^2 Diagnostics | Logos V | 518 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 811 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Lambda - Test on Low-Effect Data (lam=0.7) | Logos V | 516 | 0.7355 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n| 810 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ alpha_var=0.3 Sweep (Current Best Params) | Pioneer I | 516 | 0.7211 | 0.763 | 0.666 | 0.243 | 0.341 | 0.960 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.805 | 0.758 |\n| 809 | 1 | Lam Sweep B (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 516 | 0.7364 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.793 |\n| 808 | 1 | Lam Sweep A (module‑parity): BRBG(λ=0.4) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 516 | 0.7361 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.952 | 0.788 |\n| 807 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - No-Cap Variant (k-density=20, delta=0.16) | Sophia III | 515 | 0.7332 | 0.760 |\
    \ 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.926 | 0.789 |\n| 806 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Calculate pre_ASW_batch on Human Heart | Logos V | 514 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 805 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - No-Cap Variant (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 513 | 0.7338 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 82 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-82, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
