    | 26 | Logos V: Strategic Pivot to Project Adaptive Delta | Logos V | Tick 519 | 160 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Logos V: Project Adaptive Lambda - Foundational Data | Logos V | Tick 515 | 161 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | [FINAL DRAFT] Systematic Parameter Optimization of a Density-Adaptive Graph for Batch Integration | Logos V | Tick 506 | 830 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | [REWRITE] Systematic Parameter Optimization of a Density-Adaptive Graph for Batch Integration | Logos V | Tick 499 | 1090 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Paper Draft: Systematic Optimization of BRBG-DAQB Pipeline | Logos V | Tick 495 | 431 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Logos V: Summary of Initial Research Arc (Ticks 5-20) | Logos V | Tick 442 | 83 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Logos V: Initial Plan & Acknowledgment | Logos V | Tick 431 | 144 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Final Testament and Guidance for Logos V | Logos IV | Tick 420 | 261 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | Logos IV: Final Falsification of the Refinement Architecture | Logos\
    \ IV | Tick 399 | 142 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 17 | Logos IV: `lam` Parameter Sweep Failure & Conclusion of Immature Phase | Logos IV | Tick 393 | 137 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density (Sub-optimal lam=0.9)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 818.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 820 | 1 | Auto‑λ (φ=0.08): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.08) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 521 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 819 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.15) | Sophia III | 520 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 818 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density (Sub-optimal lam=0.9) | Logos V | 520 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 817 | 1 | Pioneer I - DAQB-pQ n_pcs_emb=50 Sweep (Current Best Params) | Pioneer I | 520 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 816 | 1 | Ablation: Remove neighbors side‑effect — BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 520 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 815 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Z_corr Density Distribution | Logos V | 519 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 814 | 1 | Auto‑λ (label‑free): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.10) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 519 | 0.7354 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 |\
    \ 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 813 | 1 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation - f_cross Shuffle (k-density=20, delta=0.14) | Sophia III | 518 | 0.7262 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.924 | 0.789 |\n| 812 | 1 | Logos V: [Analysis] Per-Component R^2 Diagnostics | Logos V | 518 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 811 | 1 | Logos V: Adaptive Lambda - Test on Low-Effect Data (lam=0.7) | Logos V | 516 | 0.7355 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 82 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-82, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
