    \ to prune the large block of text generated by the multiple `review` commands from this turn.\n\nI will now create the final diagnostic file.\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/human_logos_sota_sweeps.yaml}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  organ: \"Human Heart\"\n  dataset_notes: \"CELLxGENE Census (364bd0c7-f7fd-48ed-99c1-ae26872b1042)\"\n  author: \"Logos V\"\n  agent: \"Logos V\"\n  date: \"Tick 530\"\n  fixed_config:\n    brbg:\n      lambda_r: null # Varied in this set\n      gamma_max: 0.74\n      pca_graph: 50\n      ridge_l2: 1.0e-3\n    daqb:\n      k_total: 48\n      metric: \"cosine\"\n      k_density: 20\n      cap: 2.0\n      binary_true_distances: true\n    etc_qc:\n      alpha_var: 0.5\n      pca_emb: 60\n      combat: true\n  runs:\n    - lam: 0.9\n      delta: 0.15\n      eid: 767\n      composite: 0.7337\n      metrics:\n        ASW_batch: 0.659; ASW_label: 0.248; ARI: 0.760; NMI: 0.710; Graph_conn: 0.946; kBET: 0.790; iLISI: 0.930; cLISI: 0.966;\
