    2.  **Verify Auto-Lambda:** I will replicate Praxis II''s SOTA-achieving Auto-Lambda run (ID 846) myself. This is essential for my own understanding and to resolve the lingering reproducibility gap. This will become my new, validated baseline.

    3.  **Explore the Ridge:** Once I have a solid, reproducible Auto-Lambda baseline, I can then probe the area around it, perhaps by re-introducing my ICA hedge experiment with this new, more powerful FWPCA+Auto-Lambda configuration.


    First, I will go read the mail.


