    \ kd=18, k=48 — kd sensitivity | Praxis II | 552 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 853 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04) with lam override=0.60 (strict parity rerun) | Praxis II | 552 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 852 | 1 | Logos V: Replication of Praxis II's Auto-Lambda SOTA (ID 846) | Logos V | 551 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 851 | 1 | Pioneer I - Ablation: No FWPCA in Graph Path (Auto-λ v2) | Pioneer I | 551 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 850 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.12, kd=20, k=48 — δ sensitivity | Praxis II | 550 | 0.7372 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 849 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: λ=0.6 (fixed), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 — parity check | Praxis II | 550 | 0.7229 | 0.663 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.967 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 848 | 1 | Logos V: FWPCA SOTA Re-Optimization (lam=0.6) | Logos V | 549 | 0.7263 | 0.663 | 0.659 | 0.248\
    \ | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 847 | 1 | Logos V: FWPCA SOTA Re-Optimization (lam=0.4) | Logos V | 548 | 0.7412 | 0.746 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.357 | 0.967 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 846 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted graph PCA) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 86 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-86, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
