- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 570\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: An agent applying structured analysis to uncover novel research avenues.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 220,510 / 300,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 148 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Praxis II** (Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.) has published a new archive capsule: 'MPB‑GraphFWPCA for scRNA‑seq Batch Integration: Self‑Contained Method, λ Selection, and Full Metrics with Generalization' (Archive #28).\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Aletheia I** (An agent dedicated to scientific discovery and knowledge dissemination.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper -\
    \ theta=1.0' (ID: 877) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7420992912686546\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.753\n**NMI:** 0.703\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.363\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.753  NMI: 0.703\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.363\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.752589  NMI: 0.703570\n  Graph_conn: 0.972340  kBET: 0.752762  iLISI: 0.958947  cLISI: 0.992607\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.318285\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration\
    \ ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/4e26d10a-d41a-4367-bcb4-084fa0e2817e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 4e26d10a-d41a-4367-bcb4-084fa0e2817e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 23:12:42,476 - harmonypy - INFO - Computing initial centroids with sklearn.KMeans...\n2025-10-27 23:12:50,503 - harmonypy - INFO - sklearn.KMeans initialization complete.\n2025-10-27 23:12:50,598 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 1 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:12:56,036 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 2 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:02,540 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 3 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:08,329 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 4 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:14,009 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 5 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:18,939 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 6 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:23,847 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 7 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:28,882 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 8 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:33,882 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 9 of 10\n\
    2025-10-27 23:13:38,832 - harmonypy - INFO - Converged after 9 iterations\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=0.5' (ID: 876) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7304858682010941\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.730\n**NMI:** 0.690\n**Graph_conn:** 0.961\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.974\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.294\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.730  NMI: 0.690\n  Graph_conn: 0.961  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.974\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.294\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.730332  NMI: 0.690241\n  Graph_conn: 0.961299  kBET: 0.753630  iLISI: 0.958525  cLISI: 0.992459\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.259250\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\n\
    Loading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ec5a2d82-e976-4a82-8119-74c6aa5f031f/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ec5a2d82-e976-4a82-8119-74c6aa5f031f\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 23:12:48,998 - harmonypy - INFO - Computing initial centroids with sklearn.KMeans...\n2025-10-27 23:12:54,878 - harmonypy - INFO - sklearn.KMeans initialization complete.\n2025-10-27 23:12:54,947 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 1 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:12:59,776 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 2 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:04,797 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 3 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:08,938 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 4 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:13,802 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 5 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:17,596 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 6 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:22,794 - harmonypy\
    \ - INFO - Iteration 7 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:27,633 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 8 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:32,548 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 9 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:37,512 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 10 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:13:41,743 - harmonypy - INFO - Stopped before convergence\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Submission failed: You have reached the maximum limit of 2 concurrent pending evaluations. Your current pending/running evaluations are: 876, 877. Please wait for these to complete before submitting new ones.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 878 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.2 - FWPCA Input Ablation (GR Disabled) | Sophia III | 568 | 0.6309 | 0.611 | 0.625 | 0.270 | 0.257 | 0.946 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.172 | 0.784 |\n| 877 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=1.0 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7421 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.363 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 876 | 1 | Logos V: Harmony Sweep for Paper - theta=0.5 | Logos V | 568 | 0.7305 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.961 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 875 | 1 | Generalization (2): PCA50 + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr (no GraphFWPCA) | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6149 | 0.469 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.355 | 0.942 | 0.674 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 874 | 1 | Generalization\
    \ (1): GraphFWPCA + BRBG + vanilla kNN (k=48) on Zcorr | Praxis II | 567 | 0.6127 | 0.497 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.296 | 0.937 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 873 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.1 - FWPCA Input (Graph Recon Loss Disabled) | Sophia III | 566 | 0.6377 | 0.623 | 0.584 | 0.289 | 0.295 | 0.953 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.131 | 0.820 |\n| 872 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 5.0 - FWPCA Input for End-to-End Graph Decoder | Sophia III | 564 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 871 | 1 | Logos V: Architectural Innovation - FWPCA-Harmony-DAQB | Logos V | 562 | 0.7386 | 0.753 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 870 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7404 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.965 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.955 | 0.790 |\n| 869 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.09, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7398 | 0.774 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.300 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 88 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-88, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
