    \ 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:35,407 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 3 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:39,785 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 4 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:44,092 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 5 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:49,309 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 6 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:54,346 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 7 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:50:59,311 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 8 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:51:03,215 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 9 of 10\n2025-10-27 23:51:07,113 - harmonypy - INFO - Converged after 9 iterations\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n2. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Action failed: Block 1: Ticks already pruned: [563, 564, 565, 566, 567, 568, 569, 570]\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\
    \n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 578 | 1200 |\n| 577 | 1388 |\n| 576 | 1216 |\n| 575 | 1231 |\n| 574 | 1367 |\n| 573 | 1209 |\n| 572 | 1335 |\n| 571 | 2466 |\n| 562 | 1713 |\n| 561 | 1324 |\n| 560 | 1263 |\n| 559 | 1660 |\n| 558 | 1344 |\n| 557 | 1674 |\n| 556 | 748 |\n| 555 | 886 |\n| 554 | 1781 |\n| 531 | 1236 |\n| 529 | 837 |\n| 528 | 875 |\n| 527 (Protected) | 2335 |\n| 526 | 887 |\n| 525 | 1229 |\n| 524 | 1356 |\n| 523 | 1366 |\n| 522 | 1910 |\n| 521 | 1798 |\n| 520 | 1943 |\n| 519 | 1648 |\n| 518 | 4711 |\n| 517 | 847 |\n| 516 | 1167 |\n| 515 | 1357 |\n| 514 | 533 |\n| 513 | 1483 |\n| 512 | 1110 |\n| 511 | 1466 |\n| 510 | 1683 |\n| 509 (Protected) | 706 |\n| 508 | 1244 |\n| 507 | 683 |\n| 506 | 1908 |\n| 505 | 1637 |\n| 504 | 735 |\n| 503 | 841 |\n| 502 | 913 |\n| 501 | 2806 |\n| 500 | 694 |\n| 499 | 1343 |\n| 498 | 680 |\n| 497 (Protected) | 1660 |\n| 479 | 1011 |\n| 473 (Protected) | 1087 |\n| 445 | 1539\
    \ |\n| 444 | 708 |\n| 443 | 1096 |\n| 442 | 1179 |\n| 441 | 1300 |\n| 440 | 631 |\n| 439 (Protected) | 1516 |\n| 438 | 845 |\n| 437 | 1977 |\n| 436 | 1192 |\n| 435 | 1189 |\n| 434 | 1138 |\n| 433 | 1359 |\n| 432 | 1100 |\n| 431 | 1396 |\n| 430 (Protected) | 1896 |\n| 429 (Protected) | 1807 |\n| 428 (Protected) | 1992 |\n| 427 | 352 |\n| 426 | 596 |\n| 425 (Protected) | 479 |\n| 424 | 322 |\n| 423 (Protected) | 613 |\n| 422 (Protected) | 947 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
