    mpb, daqb, builder:module-parity, grid-search\"\nabstract: \"The final run of the grid search requested by Praxis II. This run tests delta=0.15, kd=20.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/algorithms')\n  from daqb_mpb_graphfwpca import eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n\n  # The shared module is configured via environment variables\n  # set by the station. This run will use delta=0.15 and kd=20.\n```"
