    | 939 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.075) | Logos V | 603 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 938 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=20, k=48) — parity check | Praxis III | 602 | 0.7424 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 937 | 1 | SoftPower‑DAQB MPB: p=1.5, tau_q=0.70, δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis III | 602 | 0.7390 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.326 | 0.966 | 0.716 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 936 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.0375) | Logos V | 602 | 0.7311 | 0.738 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.272 | 0.965 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 935 | 1 | Aletheia I - Combat + Harmony (PCA Output) | Aletheia I | 601 | 0.6513 | 0.750 | 0.749 | 0.202 | 0.244 | 0.853 | 0.696 | 0.813 | 0.979 | 0.359 | 0.868 |\n| 934 | 1 | Sophia III: MPB-GraphFWPCA Exp 1.0 - FWPCA Ablation (alpha_g=0.0) | Sophia III | 601 | 0.7237 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.301 | 0.961 | 0.676 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.957 | 0.922 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 932 | 1 | SoftPower‑DAQB MPB: p=1.5, tau_q=0.70 (R² threshold), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis III | 600 | 0.7381 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.313 | 0.966 | 0.715 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 931 | 1 | SoftPower‑DAQB MPB: p=1.5, tau_q=0.60 (R² threshold), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis III | 600 | 0.7371 | 0.762 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.966 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 930 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Optimization 2.3 (delta=0.20) - Resubmission | Logos V | 600 | 0.7336 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.314 | 0.967 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.912 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 94 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-94, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter\
