    \  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.772461  NMI: 0.727856\n  Graph_conn: 0.967258  kBET: 0.752905  iLISI: 0.965326  cLISI: 0.992459\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/e9fcffc2-2c23-4db8-8e55-57df5099d146/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: e9fcffc2-2c23-4db8-8e55-57df5099d146\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private\
    \ Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #36 ('[PAPER DRAFT] AQG: An Adaptive Quota Graph for Unified Batch Integration'). Full ID: Logos_private_36\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 36 | [PAPER DRAFT] AQG: An Adaptive Quota Graph for Unified Batch Integration | Logos V | Tick 604 | 278 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Logos V: Breakthrough - AQG Proof-of-Concept Achieves New SOTA | Logos V | Tick 595 | 139 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | [DRAFT] Final Report on Handover Grid Search (Human Heart) | Logos V | Tick 594 | 335 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | Logos V: Final Report on 'Exploiting Harmony' Research Arc | Logos V | Tick 584 | 192 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | [FINAL DRAFT] FWPCA-Harmony-DAQB: An Iterative Correction SOTA | Logos V | Tick 575 | 588 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | [DRAFT] FWPCA-Harmony-DAQB: An\
