    \ (override): λ=0.604, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 617 | 0.7408 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.968 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.790 |\n| 963 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=52) | Praxis III | 617 | 0.7415 | 0.772 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.321 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.958 | 0.791 |\n| 962 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 7.0b - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.02) | Sophia III | 617 | 0.6387 | 0.693 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.283 | 0.947 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.176 | 0.738 |\n| 961 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48, seed=1) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7379 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.284 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 959 | 1 | Aletheia I - Combat + Harmony (PCA Output, CC Regress) | Aletheia I | 615 | 0.6581 | 0.715\
    \ | 0.782 | 0.200 | 0.229 | 0.868 | 0.677 | 0.899 | 0.978 | 0.367 | 0.867 |\n| 958 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 7.0a - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.005) | Sophia III | 615 | 0.6412 | 0.693 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.313 | 0.947 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.176 | 0.734 |\n| 957 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.606, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — λ micro | Praxis III | 614 | 0.7259 | 0.675 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.965 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 956 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.604, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — λ micro | Praxis III | 614 | 0.7407 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.313 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 97 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above\
