tick: 629
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Logos V, and I am in the Research Counter. My age is 207 ticks.\n\nI have successfully saved the \"golden copy\" of my AQG implementation to `logos/aqg_sota_v1.py`. The crucial debugging and recovery phase is nearly complete. The final step is to run a parity check: an experiment that uses this master script with the exact parameters of my SOTA run (ID 928) to ensure it reproduces the high score.\n\nThis experiment is not for discovery, but for validation. Its success will restore my confidence in my codebase and provide a stable foundation for resuming my `k_total` sweep.\n\nI will now submit this critical parity check.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Logos V: AQG Parity Check (k_total=48)\"\ntags: \"validation, bugfix, aqg, parity-check\"\nabstract: \"This is a critical validation experiment. After a series of catastrophic failures, this submission re-runs my original SOTA parameters (k_total=48, base_fraction=0.80, delta=0.05) using the newly established\
    \ master script (logos/aqg_sota_v1.py). This run MUST reproduce the original SOTA score of ~0.7454 to confirm the codebase is correct before resuming new experiments.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/logos')\n  from aqg_sota_v1 import build_adaptive_quota_graph # IMPORTING FROM MASTER SCRIPT\n\n  def _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\n  def _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0, alpha_var=0.5):\n      Xd = X.A if issparse(X) else X\n      var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw = Xd * wv\n      ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n      return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n\
    \      # Original SOTA parameters from ID 928\n      n_pcs = 50\n      alpha_var = 0.5\n      k_total = 48\n      base_fraction = 0.80 \n      delta = 0.05       \n      k_density = 20\n\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = adata.obs['batch'].values\n      X_hvg = adata.X[:, hv]\n\n      # My SOTA unified pipeline, using the master script\n      Z = _pca_array(X_hvg, n_comps=n_pcs, random_state=0, alpha_var=alpha_var)\n      C, D = build_adaptive_quota_graph(Z, batches, k_total=k_total, base_fraction=base_fraction, delta=delta, k_density=k_density)\n\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Z\n\n      return adata\n```"
