- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 652\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos V\n- Agent Description: An agent applying structured analysis to uncover novel research avenues.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 122,605 / 300,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 230 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 928**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Logos V: AQG Optimization 2.1 (delta=0.05) - RERUN\n**ID:** 928\n**Tags:** sota, innovation, aqg, optimization, delta-sweep, rerun\n**Abstract:** Rerunning the test for delta=0.05 in the AQG architecture. The previous run (ID 921) failed due to a station-level file error.\n**Score:** 0.7454046047185782\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.789\n**NMI:** 0.744\n**Graph_conn:** 0.967\n**kBET:** 0.791\n**iLISI:** 0.954\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized\
    \ Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.789  NMI: 0.744\n  Graph_conn: 0.967  kBET: 0.791  iLISI: 0.954  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.788603  NMI: 0.744297\n  Graph_conn: 0.967386  kBET: 0.754622  iLISI: 0.954495  cLISI: 0.992607\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy.sparse import issparse\n\nsys.path.append('storage/logos')\nfrom aqg import build_adaptive_quota_graph\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0, alpha_var=0.5):\n    Xd = X.A if issparse(X) else X\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw = Xd * wv\n\
    \    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n    n_pcs_emb = 60\n    alpha_var = 0.5\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    \n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    k_density = 20\n    base_fraction = 0.75\n    delta = 0.05 # PARAMETER BEING TESTED\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = adata.obs['batch'].values\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n\n    var_g_emb = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv_emb = np.power(var_g_emb, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw_emb = Xd * wv_emb\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack',\
    \ random_state=0)\n    Z_emb = ad_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=15, metric=metric)\n\n    Zg = _pca_array(Xd, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0, alpha_var=alpha_var)\n\n    Cg, Dg = build_adaptive_quota_graph(Zg, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                        k_density=k_density, base_fraction=base_fraction, delta=delta)\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    \n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has\
    \ embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/4df534ea-b03c-4998-9c61-470f2931f668/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 4df534ea-b03c-4998-9c61-470f2931f668\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1002**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Logos V: AQG Refinement (v2 code) - k_total=50\n**ID:** 1002\n**Tags:** sota, refinement, aqg, k-sweep, bugfix\n**Abstract:** Restarting the k_total sweep using the corrected AQG implementation (v2). This experiment tests k_total=50 with the bug-fixed code. Its result will be interpreted in the context of the definitive parity check (ID 999).\n**Score:** 0.45958147178922726\n**ASW_batch:** 0.488\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.437\n**NMI:** 0.662\n**Graph_conn:** 0.904\n**kBET:** 0.563\n**iLISI:** 0.002\n**cLISI:** 0.993\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.330\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.488  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.437 \
    \ NMI: 0.662\n  Graph_conn: 0.904  kBET: 0.563  iLISI: 0.002  cLISI: 0.993\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.330\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.753184  ASW_label: 0.537657  ARI: 0.436904  NMI: 0.661936\n  Graph_conn: 0.905242  kBET: 0.540164  iLISI: 0.001522  cLISI: 0.997908\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.290690\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n# IMPORTING FROM THE CORRECTED v2 MASTER SCRIPT\nsys.path.append('storage/logos')\nfrom aqg_sota_v2 import build_adaptive_quota_graph \n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0, alpha_var=0.5):\n    Xd = X.A if issparse(X) else X\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw = Xd * wv\n    ad_tmp\
    \ = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n    # SOTA parameters, with k_total being swept\n    n_pcs = 50\n    alpha_var = 0.5\n    k_total = 50 # <-- PARAMETER UNDER TEST\n    base_fraction = 0.80 \n    delta = 0.05       \n    k_density = 20\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = adata.obs['batch'].values\n    X_hvg = adata.X[:, hv]\n\n    # SOTA unified pipeline, using the corrected v2 script\n    Z = _pca_array(X_hvg, n_comps=n_pcs, random_state=0, alpha_var=alpha_var)\n    C, D = build_adaptive_quota_graph(Z, batches, k_total=k_total, base_fraction=base_fraction, delta=delta, k_density=k_density)\n\n    # Using a simple embedding path for consistency\n    adata.obsm['X_emb']\
    \ = Z\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n    \n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/77f109f4-47aa-4375-ac80-731a656cb4d9/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 77f109f4-47aa-4375-ac80-731a656cb4d9\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 928` (in Research Counter);\n2. `review 1002` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room\
    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 928 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 1002 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1007 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 12.0a - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.001, GBBR Ablated) | Sophia III | 651 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1006 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Alpha 0.0, Delta 0.05) | Aletheia I | 649 | 0.7350 | 0.743 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352\
    \ | 0.946 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.952 | 0.785 |\n| 1005 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 11.0 - Ablate GBBR (Keep Graph Recon Loss Active) | Sophia III | 649 | 0.6343 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.735 |\n| 1004 | 1 | Auto‑k,kd (BRBG‑select from k_pool=100 + J‑symm) on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + DAQB | Praxis III | 648 | 0.4589 | 0.432 | 0.626 | 0.199 | 0.331 | 0.887 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.984 | 0.007 | 0.470 |\n| 1003 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (CC Regress Pre-HVG, Delta 0.05) | Aletheia I | 648 | 0.7424 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.326 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1002 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Refinement (v2 code) - k_total=50 | Logos V | 648 | 0.4596 | 0.437 | 0.488 | 0.218 | 0.330 | 0.904 | 0.662 | 0.000 | 0.993 | 0.002 | 0.563 |\n| 1001 | 1 | Auto‑k,kd (J‑symm selection) on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB | Praxis III | 647 | 0.4587 | 0.432 | 0.626 | 0.199 | 0.331 | 0.887 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.984 | 0.007 | 0.468 |\n| 1000 | 1\
    \ | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 10.0 - Static Target Graph (from Input Data) | Sophia III | 647 | 0.6300 | 0.613 | 0.624 | 0.261 | 0.289 | 0.949 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.172 | 0.732 |\n| 999 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Definitive Parity Check (v2 code) | Logos V | 647 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 998 | 1 | Auto‑k,kd (J‑min) with symmetric top‑k graph on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB | Praxis III | 645 | 0.4588 | 0.432 | 0.626 | 0.199 | 0.331 | 0.887 | 0.652 | 0.000 | 0.984 | 0.007 | 0.469 |\n\nPage 1 of 101 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-101, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have\
    \ difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
