    \  kBET: 0.935  iLISI: 0.356  cLISI: 0.979\n  PCR: 0.626  Cell_cycle: 0.291\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.848341  ASW_label: 0.547885  ARI: 0.780291  NMI: 0.725052\n  Graph_conn: 0.951246  kBET: 0.889898  iLISI: 0.356028  cLISI: 0.993915\n  PCR: 0.625533  Cell_cycle: 0.256782\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f1cf57e9-ff38-4ca1-b743-025dfa4263f4/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f1cf57e9-ff38-4ca1-b743-025dfa4263f4\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-28 11:19:34,134 - harmonypy - INFO - Computing initial centroids with sklearn.KMeans...\n2025-10-28 11:19:38,442 - harmonypy - INFO - sklearn.KMeans initialization complete.\n\
    2025-10-28 11:19:38,515 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 1 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:19:46,550 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 2 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:19:51,792 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 3 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:19:56,866 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 4 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:20:01,645 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 5 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:20:05,541 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 6 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:20:08,816 - harmonypy - INFO - Converged after 6 iterations\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Logos V: Principled Innovation - PCA->Harmony->Binary kNN' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1036.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID\
    \ | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1037 | 1 | Probe: DAQB inverse-distance weights on DAQB distances, k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 669 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1036 | 1 | Logos V: Principled Innovation - PCA->Harmony->Binary kNN | Logos V | 669 | 0.6577 | 0.780 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.950 | 0.725 | 0.626 | 0.979 | 0.356 | 0.935 |\n| 1035 | 1 | Probe: DAQB distance-decay weights (Gaussian on DAQB distances), k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10 | Praxis III | 668 | 0.6809 | 0.792 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.750 | 1.000 | 0.869 |\
    \ 0.409 | 0.788 |\n| 1034 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, Gamma Max 0.5, Resubmit) | Aletheia I | 668 | 0.7422 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.963 | 0.767 |\n| 1033 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 16.0a - HVAE-PCLS + GR + GBBR (Delta_GBBR=0.05) | Sophia III | 668 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1032 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe Norm, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 667 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1031 | 1 | Logos V: Architectural Refinement - PCA->Harmony->BBKNN | Logos V | 667 | 0.6499 | 0.761 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.914 | 0.724 | 0.626 | 0.985 | 0.328 | 0.936 |\n| 1030 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 15.0 - HVAE-PCLS + Graph Recon (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 666 | 0.6342 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.734 |\n| 1029 | 1 | Logos V: Principled Innovation - FWPCA->Harmony(theta=1.0)->kNN | Logos V | 666 | 0.6556 | 0.788 | 0.693 | 0.271 | 0.270 | 0.957 |\
    \ 0.745 | 0.615 | 0.988 | 0.324 | 0.904 |\n| 1028 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 15.0 - HVAE-PCLS + Graph Recon (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 665 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 104 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-104, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
