    \ harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 1 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:31:46,076 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 2 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:31:49,986 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 3 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:31:53,821 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 4 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:31:57,806 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 5 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:32:02,256 - harmonypy - INFO - Iteration 6 of 20\n2025-10-28 11:32:05,685 - harmonypy - INFO - Converged after 6 iterations\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
